  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb, no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Often used reflexively: **juntarse** (to get together, to meet up), e.g. *nos juntamos el sábado* (we're getting together on Saturday)",
    "Common usage: *juntar dinero* (to save up/gather money), *juntar las manos* (to put your hands together)",
    "Related adjective: **junto/a** (together, next to) — *vivimos juntos* (we live together)"
